AD HOC NEWS","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"D-Wave Quantum：佛羅裡達基地、價值 2000 萬美元的 FAU 訂單以及尚未得到證實的訴訟"},{"title":"D-Wave Quantum: What a Financed Machine in Como and a Minnesota Foundry Deal Say About the Business","src":"AD HOC NEWS","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"D-Wave Quantum：科莫的融資機器和明尼蘇達代工廠交易對業務的影響"},{"title":"D-Wave Quantum: A Delivered Machine, an Extended Foundry Deal and the Tax Withholding That Isn't a S","src":"AD HOC NEWS","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"D-Wave Quantum：已交付的機器、延長的代工協議以及非 S 的預扣稅"}],"themes":[{"name":"半導體/晶片","count":5},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":2},{"name":"加密貨幣","count":1},{"name":"財報","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-26","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1907982/000190798226000026/qbts-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Unless the context requires otherwise, references in this section to \"D-Wave,\" \"we,\" \"our\" or \"us\" refer to D-Wave Quantum Inc., a Delaware corporation, and its consolidated subsidiaries following the consummation of the Transaction, and prior to the consummation of the Transaction, to D-Wave Systems Inc., a British Columbia corporation (\"D-Wave Systems\").","zh":"除非上下文另有要求，本節中提及的「D-Wave」、「我們」、「我們的」或「我們的」是指交易完成後的特拉華州公司 D-Wave Quantum Inc. 及其合併子公司，以及交易完成前的不列顛哥倫比亞省公司 D-Wave Systems Inc.（「D-Wave Systems」）。"},{"en":"At D-Wave, our mission is to help customers realize the value of quantum computing to address complex computational problems that cannot be solved with classical computing alone. As a pioneer in the quantum industry for more than 25 years, D-Wave is the world's first company to deliver commercial-grade annealing quantum computing systems and solutions. We are also the only dual-platform quantum computing company, providing both annealing and gate-model systems, software, and services to address customers' full range of computational problems. We believe that we are leading the industry in ushering in the era of enterprise quantum computing. We are driving the transition from academic endeavors exploring quantum's potential to enterprise-scale adoption and deployment, solving some of the world's toughest problems. Based on our strategic decision to initially bring to market a type of quan","zh":"在 D-Wave，我們的使命是幫助客戶認識到量子運算的價值，以解決僅靠經典運算無法解決的複雜運算問題。作為量子產業超過 25 年的先驅，D-Wave 是世界上第一家提供商業級退火量子運算系統和解決方案的公司。我們也是唯一一家雙平台量子計算公司，提供退火和閘門模型系統、軟體和服務，以解決客戶的全方位運算問題。我們相信，我們正在引領業界迎來企業量子運算時代。我們正在推動從探索量子潛力的學術努力向企業規模的採用和部署轉變，解決世界上一些最棘手的問題。基於我們的策略決策，首先將一種 quan 推向市場"},{"en":"Our market leadership position is evident—we were the first to launch commercial quantum systems, the first to achieve a demonstration of quantum supremacy on a useful, real-world problem, the first to have quantum applications running in production for commercial customers, and the first with commercial customer use of its quantum computing technology with AI model training.","zh":"我們的市場領導地位是顯而易見的——我們是第一個推出商業量子系統的公司，第一個在有用的現實世界問題上實現量子霸權的演示的公司，第一個為商業客戶在生產中運行量子應用程序的公司，第一個讓商業客戶使用其量子計算技術和人工智慧模型訓練的公司。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Quantum use cases: We are now observing an expansion in certain quantum use cases, notably optimization-based, that are beginning to move into production, with customers identifying real business problems, developing quantum hybrid proofs-of-concept, piloting them, and then running those use cases in production environments, thus fueling their daily operations. But we believe this is just the beginning. As annealing quantum computing becomes more powerful and gate-model systems come online in the future, other pre-production and production use cases are expected to emerge.","zh":"量子用例：我們現在正在觀察某些量子用例的擴展，特別是基於優化的用例，這些用例開始投入生產，客戶識別真正的業務問題，開發量子混合概念驗證，進行試點，然後在生產環境中運行這些用例，從而促進他們的日常運作。但我們相信這只是一個開始。隨著退火量子計算變得更加強大以及閘門模型系統在未來上線，預計會出現其他預生產和生產案例。"},{"en":"Hundreds of user-built early applications have been developed to run on our annealing quantum computing systems and in our hybrid solver service. Spanning a wide range of diverse industries, these applications include examples in workforce scheduling, resource optimization, production scheduling, logistics routing, and portfolio optimization.","zh":"數百個用戶建立的早期應用程式已經開發出來，可以在我們的退火量子計算系統和混合求解器服務上運行。這些應用涵蓋廣泛的不同行業，包括勞動力調度、資源優化、生產調度、物流路線和產品組合優化等範例。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The quantum computing market is highly competitive. With new technologies and entrants into the market, we expect competition to continue to increase. Our competitive differentiators include being the only provider in the world building both annealing quantum computing and gate-model quantum computing systems, being the first commercial quantum computing company, our long-term proven track record of delivering increasingly mature higher-performance quantum systems that scale, and our use cases with demonstrable business value.","zh":"量子運算市場競爭非常激烈。隨著新技術和市場進入者的出現，我們預期競爭將繼續加劇。我們的競爭優勢包括：作為世界上唯一一家同時建立退火量子運算和閘門模型量子運算系統的供應商、作為第一家商業量子運算公司、我們在提供日益成熟的高性能可擴展量子系統方面的長期良好記錄，以及我們具有可證明的商業價值的用例。"},{"en":"In addition to being the first commercial supplier of annealing quantum computing systems, we are also building gate-model quantum computing systems. At the same time, we will continue to invest in our Advantage annealing quantum computing program with a focus on future generations of increasingly more powerful and connected annealing quantum computing systems. Other companies, including Rigetti Computing, IBM, Google, IonQ, Quantinuum, QuEra, Atom, Pasqal, PsiQuantum, and Xanadu, are pursuing gate-model quantum computing, each using different technologies for the qubits and control, and each at different levels of technical maturity. Approaches include superconducting, ion traps, neutral atoms, photonics, and spin qubits. A brief summary of a few of the approaches follows:","zh":"除了成為第一家退火量子計算系統的商業供應商之外，我們還在建立閘門模型量子計算系統。同時，我們將繼續投資我們的 Advantage 退火量子計算計劃，重點是未來幾代日益強大和互聯的退火量子計算系統。其他公司，包括 RigettiComputing、IBM、Google、IonQ、Quantinuum、QuEra、Atom、Pasqal、PsiQuantum 和 Xanadu，都在追求閘模型量子運算，每家公司都使用不同的量子位元和控制技術，每家公司的技術成熟度都不同。方法包括超導、離子陷阱、中性原子、光子學和自旋量子位。以下是一些方法的簡要總結："}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"System Sales","val":16182000,"zh":"系統銷售"},{"name":"Q Caa S","val":5517000,"zh":"Q鈣硫"},{"name":"System Upgrade","val":3500000,"zh":"系統升級"},{"name":"Professional Services","val":2720000,"zh":"專業服務"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":168000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"}],"total":24587000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"DE","val":16765000,"zh":"德國"},{"name":"US","val":2654000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other Geographical Areas","val":2014000,"zh":"其他地理區域"},{"name":"JP","val":1316000,"zh":"日本"},{"name":"CH","val":960000,"zh":"CH"},{"name":"CA","val":878000,"zh":"加拿大"}],"total":24587000}},"peers":["RGTI","IONQ","QUBT","SOUN","CRWV"]}}